1
00:00:00,233 --> 00:00:01,267
Four close-ups.

2
00:00:01,767 --> 00:00:03,200
Guess what each one is.

3
00:00:03,467 --> 00:00:06,033
The answer comes after each.

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,433
Number one.

5
00:00:07,667 --> 00:00:08,533
Fine,

6
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,700
golden and light.

7
00:00:10,833 --> 00:00:11,900
It comes off the grain

8
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,000
at a rice mill.

9
00:00:15,233 --> 00:00:16,200
Rice husk.

10
00:00:16,233 --> 00:00:17,200
A common boiler fuel,

11
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,233
because it is dry

12
00:00:18,233 --> 00:00:20,633
and already collected in one place.

13
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:21,800
Number two.

14
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,833
Pale and fibrous.

15
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:24,967
It is what is left

16
00:00:24,967 --> 00:00:25,667
after the juice

17
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:29,100
is pressed out of sugarcane.

18
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,333
Bagasse.

19
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,600
Many sugar mills burn

20
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,333
it to power themselves.

21
00:00:33,633 --> 00:00:33,833
Number three.

22
00:00:33,833 --> 00:00:34,333
Light,

23
00:00:35,633 --> 00:00:36,800
papery pieces,

24
00:00:36,933 --> 00:00:39,600
left after threshing a winter oilseed.

25
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,400
Mustard husk.

26
00:00:42,867 --> 00:00:44,400
Common across Rajasthan.

27
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,500
Number four.

28
00:00:46,933 --> 00:00:47,100
Hard,

29
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,233
curved and brown.

30
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,467
Mostly from the South.

31
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,000
Coconut shell.

32
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:52,667
Dense,

33
00:00:52,667 --> 00:00:54,900
and also made into charcoal.

34
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,433
How many did you get?

35
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,700
Tell us in the comments.

36
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,067
Every one of these

37
00:00:59,067 --> 00:01:00,100
has a buyer somewhere.

38
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,833
IndiaBiomass is building

39
00:01:01,833 --> 00:01:03,167
the way to find them.
